{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_title", "source_sha256": "c765f6480a51f82d18e8e93166d9e627b7725b959f4861f64bb3592d30a7b30e", "ja": "未来とおでかけ1", "zh": "和未来出游1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4085f4cc981dd7416e267e2ef7257bf656ca0b685469775923e94cf31241da51", "ja": "未来とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和未来一同外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad23a48728b969bcb92ff83ea4bf7807ccc4fce02fee1efddf509166141b8297", "ja": "（今から地元新聞社の取材があるのに、予定の\n時間になっても未来が来ない。もしかして……）", "zh": "（明明马上就要接受当地报社的采访了，可到了预定时间未来还没来。难道……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa1e9426b7509218e0da9d5545b592176b75322ebb381d451e3a5b8d4f298d7f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ごめんなさい！\nおまたせしました～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，对不起！\n让您久等啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "90c269e1f5b389e6d7f4562727eed8fe37020e764647acd7d215877772f3e50d", "ja": "あ、未来！　よかった、\n寝坊でもしたのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊，未来！太好了，\n我还以为你睡过头了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "67e01d8d53b423d9c576e0830946070cb88438ec8d931633226e4c79bea567bb", "ja": "寝坊は、ちょっとだけ……えへへ。\nごめんなさい。", "zh": "睡过头就只有一点点啦……嘿嘿。\n对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "c92ebe992de6998ad5b69753aaadf97f6315f4c61773f6db4b14138892310450", "ja": "昨日、遅くまでインタビューの練習してたんです。\n伊織ちゃんとか、みんなにも手伝ってもらって。", "zh": "昨天，我练习到很晚才睡，一直在练采访应对。\n伊织她们，大家都帮了我的忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2f46e9a2e6f6a74c3956b006a4f91a4f29ba410237b6f2b9d67c9e2360a3067d", "ja": "そうなのか？\nずいぶん張り切ってるんだな！", "zh": "原来如此？\n你还真是干劲十足啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "a84fbad2831fbe6507d919cbe1bee095ae6f7fa333b2ff8efaeb513154d62030", "ja": "はい！　だって{$P$}さんが、\n『劇場の良さを全国に届ける』って言ってたから。", "zh": "是的！因为{$P$}先生说过，要“把剧场的精彩传遍全国”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad888516ab801f1efe5dca5b248e53e6dd16ed507d221a0cb8049742abdc53b1", "ja": "私たちのいいところ、たくさん伝えなくちゃ！って\n思ったら、止まらなくなっちゃって……でへへ♪", "zh": "一想到要把我们的优点好好传达出去，就停不下来了……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "57aa2e70a6910a7ea71430a4c53686cee2ab71b6715a58c7512b735f7d71298c", "ja": "そうか、頼もしいな。よし、\nなら今日のインタビュー、気合い全開でいこう！", "zh": "这样啊，真是可靠。好，那今天的采访就全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir01_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "094c96b5fcb1e32eccfaeb3bfe2a21d17a2afb2e3d99cfca6d22af794b1e8947", "ja": "はいっ♪　インタビューを読んだ人が、私たちを\n観に来たくなっちゃうように、がんばりまーす！", "zh": "好的♪我会努力让读到采访的人，都忍不住想来看我们的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
